Reason: firstCollisionHit chose between the grid cells under self and the target's own instance list by counting the
cells' entries first. For a target list of a few instances (Samus, as the target of every mine projectile) scanning
the list is cheaper than that count, so lists of four or fewer are scanned directly. Both ways give the same answer:
the instance first in the walk's order among those self hits.
Upstream: Speed only, every platform. Retires this patch when merged.

